From the album “Advent” by Urshan College
Intro D Em7 Bm7 G (2x)

{comment: Verse}
{ci: 1&2}
D D sus D D sus Bm 7 A
No more waiting no more wondering if the night would ever end
What a wonder….
D D sus D D sus Bm 7 A
No more silence with one baby’s cry the song of hope begins
Hearts wide open….

{comment: Pre-Chorus}
G Bm 7 A D/F# G Bm 7 A
Arise praise the Lord Emmanuel for us is born

{comment: Chorus}
D Em 7 Bm 7 G
Hallelujah the King has come the long awaited promised One
D A sus G
The hope of all the world has come to save us
D Em 7 Bm 7 G
Hallelujah let earth rejoice we join the ancient song of joy
D A sus G D
We sing for love has come Hallelujah He is here
Interlude D Em7 Bm7 G

{comment: Bridge}
G A Bm 7 D/F#
Let voices shake the sky just like that Christmas night
G A Bm 7 A/C#
Let saints arise and welcome our King here

{comment: Outro}
D Em7 Bm7 G D/A A/C# Bm 7 G D
